 "remarks": "**Beautifully Refreshed 4-Bedroom Rental in North Stamford**  Available now - this bright and airy 4-bedroom, 3-full-bath home offers nearly 3,400 sq ft in one of North Stamford's most desirable neighborhoods, just minutes from the Merritt Parkway. The entire interior has been freshly painted, giving every room a crisp, move-in-ready feel.  The updated eat-in kitchen features stainless steel appliances and flows into a large open-concept living room framed by picture windows, leading into a dining area overlooking the deck. Hardwood floors run throughout the main level, including the spacious primary bedroom with its own full bath.  Downstairs, the fully finished basement now boasts brand-new laminate flooring and includes a lower-level in-law apartment - ideal for extended family, guests, or a home office/family room setup. The attached 2-car garage has also been freshly painted for a polished, well-maintained feel.  Peace of mind comes standard: the home is fully wired with a dual-fuel generator, so you'll never have to worry about power outages.  Outside, professionally updated landscaping enhances the home's curb appeal on a private, level 1.37-acre lot with a deck perfect for relaxing outdoors. Pet policy is flexible. Easy access to the Merritt Parkway. Available for a yearly unfurnished lease - schedule your showing today!",
